{"4391420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spymaster", "steam_appid": 4391420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>A Fisherman’s Tale</i> and <i>Maskmaker</i>, InnerspaceVR returns with <strong>Spymaster. </strong>In this new single-player espionage game, you are not one elite spy but three!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the World of Espionage </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate the operations of <strong>Protocore</strong>, a global technology corporation led by ever-watchful CEO <strong>PROTUS</strong>. Monitor its worldwide surveillance system and uncover plans that threaten global stability. Execute high-risk missions for <strong>NODE</strong>, the last independent spy agency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/6861ef98061188408409218336590afa.poster.avif?t=1783978969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/6861ef98061188408409218336590afa.webm?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/6861ef98061188408409218336590afa.mp4?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Multiple Agents </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embody three playable agents, each with unique skills and weapons. Adapt approaches to the evolving challenges of each mission and combine their abilities to achieve objectives efficiently. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/cab14d586619b4c5cca77985496db845.poster.avif?t=1783978969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/cab14d586619b4c5cca77985496db845.webm?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/cab14d586619b4c5cca77985496db845.mp4?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate Time </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., a classified device, to rewind key moments, test alternative actions, and refine strategies. Every mission becomes an opportunity to optimise execution and experiment with tactics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/33752bccd5fe710551690a2dbba34851.poster.avif?t=1783978969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/33752bccd5fe710551690a2dbba34851.webm?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/33752bccd5fe710551690a2dbba34851.mp4?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve, Move, Survive </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend puzzle-solving with action sequences designed specifically for VR. Run, climb, slide, zipline, and engage in combat while maintaining continuous momentum and immersion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/5105db3760b6957f8e7227a7532b009f.poster.avif?t=1783978969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/5105db3760b6957f8e7227a7532b009f.webm?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/5105db3760b6957f8e7227a7532b009f.mp4?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on Mastery </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a premium single-player VR adventure that rewards planning and precision. Rewind your actions, experiment with different strategies, and perfect every operation to become a <strong>Spymaster</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/9c6ba6e3487c618c93d65c5ca7067840.poster.avif?t=1783978969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/9c6ba6e3487c618c93d65c5ca7067840.webm?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/9c6ba6e3487c618c93d65c5ca7067840.mp4?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Secret Agent - </strong>Step into the role of 3 different spies to save the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewind Time - </strong>Use Spymaster’s Temporal Replay System to finesse each mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Missions </strong>- No two missions are alike, from defusing bombs to poisoning villains, each becomes more challenging, requiring a different approach </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E. - </strong>Use this high-tech gadget to precisely plan each mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unbroken Momentum - </strong>Run, climb, slide, zipline and shoot your way to safety</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>A Fisherman’s Tale</i> and <i>Maskmaker</i>, InnerspaceVR returns with <strong>Spymaster. </strong>In this new single-player espionage game, you are not one elite spy but three!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the World of Espionage </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate the operations of <strong>Protocore</strong>, a global technology corporation led by ever-watchful CEO <strong>PROTUS</strong>. Monitor its worldwide surveillance system and uncover plans that threaten global stability. Execute high-risk missions for <strong>NODE</strong>, the last independent spy agency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/6861ef98061188408409218336590afa.poster.avif?t=1783978969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/6861ef98061188408409218336590afa.webm?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/6861ef98061188408409218336590afa.mp4?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Multiple Agents </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embody three playable agents, each with unique skills and weapons. Adapt approaches to the evolving challenges of each mission and combine their abilities to achieve objectives efficiently. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/cab14d586619b4c5cca77985496db845.poster.avif?t=1783978969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/cab14d586619b4c5cca77985496db845.webm?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/cab14d586619b4c5cca77985496db845.mp4?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate Time </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., a classified device, to rewind key moments, test alternative actions, and refine strategies. Every mission becomes an opportunity to optimise execution and experiment with tactics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/33752bccd5fe710551690a2dbba34851.poster.avif?t=1783978969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/33752bccd5fe710551690a2dbba34851.webm?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/33752bccd5fe710551690a2dbba34851.mp4?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve, Move, Survive </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend puzzle-solving with action sequences designed specifically for VR. Run, climb, slide, zipline, and engage in combat while maintaining continuous momentum and immersion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/5105db3760b6957f8e7227a7532b009f.poster.avif?t=1783978969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/5105db3760b6957f8e7227a7532b009f.webm?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/5105db3760b6957f8e7227a7532b009f.mp4?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on Mastery </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a premium single-player VR adventure that rewards planning and precision. Rewind your actions, experiment with different strategies, and perfect every operation to become a <strong>Spymaster</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/9c6ba6e3487c618c93d65c5ca7067840.poster.avif?t=1783978969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/9c6ba6e3487c618c93d65c5ca7067840.webm?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/extras/9c6ba6e3487c618c93d65c5ca7067840.mp4?t=1783978969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Secret Agent - </strong>Step into the role of 3 different spies to save the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewind Time - </strong>Use Spymaster’s Temporal Replay System to finesse each mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Missions </strong>- No two missions are alike, from defusing bombs to poisoning villains, each becomes more challenging, requiring a different approach </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E. - </strong>Use this high-tech gadget to precisely plan each mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unbroken Momentum - </strong>Run, climb, slide, zipline and shoot your way to safety</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "In a world where privacy and trust are a luxury most can’t afford, the agents of NODE are the last line of defence. Combining action-packed sequences and puzzle-solving in immersive missions, command three elite agents with unique skills and manipulate time using the top secret C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/6cde92820b9124a22b015ab6536f8cce6ab281df/header.jpg?t=1783978969", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/66bff9af2e63c89aa6d4783fea800e2f3d1639ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783978969", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391420/66bff9af2e63c89aa6d4783fea800e2f3d1639ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783978969", "website": "https://www.innerspacevr.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 or AMD FX 8350 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 970 or AMD Radeon R9 290 or greater<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Quest, Quest 2, Quest 3, Valve Index (with both Knuckles and Wands controllers), Rift, Rift S, Pico 4</li></ul>",